                            <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900">
                                Chassis: Turbo Charged, 3 Cylinders, Inline, 12-Valve DOHC VVT-i
                            </h3>
                        </div>

                        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 p-5 md:col-span-2">

                            <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-400">
